OL,3,GNEWSA#9m spent on road widening scheme
OL,4,Awith no start date
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout #9m has been spent developing
OL,7,Fplans to widen one of Londonderry's
OL,8,Fbusiest roads, despite construction
OL,9,Fwork never beginning.
OL,11,FProposals to expand the A2 Buncrana
OL,12,FRoad from two lanes to four were first
OL,13,Fput forward in 2005.
OL,15,FThe Department for Infrastructure (DfI)
OL,16,Fpaused the scheme in 2023, but said at
OL,17,Fthe time it remained committed to the
OL,18,Fproject.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
