OL,3,GNEWSA#9m spent on road widening scheme
OL,4,Awith no start date
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe department has now said it has
OL,7,Fspent "approximately #9m" on developing
OL,8,Fthe scheme, adding there is currently
OL,9,Fno estimated start date for work to
OL,10,Fbegin.
